# The image is built from pyproject.toml, uv.lock, src/, web/ and
# packaging/docker.
# Everything else stays out, above all the keys of .env and the local data.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!packaging/docker/
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[oc]
src/sok/ui/
src/sok/main.py
